    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Agora: The Future of Digital Board Gaming</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <i>Agora</i>, a social-driven board game platform that connects players and independent studios in immersive 3D environments. Discover unique games, meet new friends, and enjoy seamless digital gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Play Unique Board Games</strong> \u2013 Explore a curated selection of independent titles with built-in rule enforcement for smooth gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Immersive 3D Environments</strong> \u2013 Play in stunning, game-specific settings that enhance every match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f <strong>Social-First Gaming</strong> \u2013 Join voice channels, meet new friends, and recreate the magic of in-person board game nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uded2 <strong>Support Independent Studios</strong> \u2013 Discover and support innovative board game creators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Express Yourself</strong> \u2013 Customize your avatar with unique skins and accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Free</strong> \u2013 Play for free alone or with some friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why Choose Agora?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike other platforms, Agora prioritizes quality with immersive 3D environments, automated rules, and strong social features. Whether you're a veteran or a newcomer, Agora is the ultimate destination for digital board gaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Join the Beta Today and Be Part of the Future of Board Gaming!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Agora: The Future of Digital Board Gaming</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <i>Agora</i>, a social-driven board game platform that connects players and independent studios in immersive 3D environments. Discover unique games, meet new friends, and enjoy seamless digital gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Play Unique Board Games</strong> \u2013 Explore a curated selection of independent titles with built-in rule enforcement for smooth gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Immersive 3D Environments</strong> \u2013 Play in stunning, game-specific settings that enhance every match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f <strong>Social-First Gaming</strong> \u2013 Join voice channels, meet new friends, and recreate the magic of in-person board game nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uded2 <strong>Support Independent Studios</strong> \u2013 Discover and support innovative board game creators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Express Yourself</strong> \u2013 Customize your avatar with unique skins and accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Free</strong> \u2013 Play for free alone or with some friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why Choose Agora?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike other platforms, Agora prioritizes quality with immersive 3D environments, automated rules, and strong social features. Whether you're a veteran or a newcomer, Agora is the ultimate destination for digital board gaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Join the Beta Today and Be Part of the Future of Board Gaming!</strong></p>",
